      "definition": "(1) \"Electronic wireless communications device\" includes any of the following:\n\n(a) A wireless telephone;\n\n(b) A text-messaging device;\n\n(c) A personal digital assistant;\n\n(d) A computer, including a laptop computer and a computer tablet;\n\n(e) Any device capable of displaying a video, movie, broadcast television image, or visual image;\n\n(f) Any other substantially similar wireless device that is designed or used to communicate text, initiate or receive communication, or exchange information or data.",
      "id": "4511.204-electronic-wireless-communications-device",
      "normalized": "electronic wireless communications device",
      "scope": "(H) As used in this section:",
      "section": "4511.204",
      "source_title": "Section 4511.204 - Driving while texting.",
      "source_url": "https://codes.ohio.gov/ohio-revised-code/section-4511.204",
      "term": "Electronic wireless communications device"
    },
    {
      "definition": "An \"electronic wireless communications device\" does not include a two-way radio transmitter or receiver used by a person who is licensed by the federal communications commission to participate in the amateur radio service.",
      "id": "4511.204-electronic-wireless-communications-device",
      "normalized": "electronic wireless communications device",
      "scope": "(H) As used in this section:",
      "section": "4511.204",
      "source_title": "Section 4511.204 - Driving while texting.",
      "source_url": "https://codes.ohio.gov/ohio-revised-code/section-4511.204",
      "term": "electronic wireless communications device"
    },
    {
      "definition": "(2) \"Voice-operated or hands-free feature or function\" means a feature or function that allows a person to use an electronic wireless communications device without the use of either hand, except to activate, deactivate, or initiate the feature or function with a single touch or single swipe.",
      "id": "4511.204-voice-operated-or-hands-free-feature-or-function",
      "normalized": "voice-operated or hands-free feature or function",
      "scope": "(H) As used in this section:",
      "section": "4511.204",
      "source_title": "Section 4511.204 - Driving while texting.",
      "source_url": "https://codes.ohio.gov/ohio-revised-code/section-4511.204",
      "term": "Voice-operated or hands-free feature or function"
    },
    {
      "definition": "(3) \"Utility\" means an entity specified in division (A), (C), (D), (E), or (G) of section 4905.03 of the Revised Code.",
